(room PLATFORM-ROOM
  :description "At Platform"
  :ldesc "You stand before a low rock platform, more like an afterthought of
piled rocks or a glacial moraine than a work of artifice. You are
pushed against the pile by the crowd around you."
  :flags (ONBIT)

