;         (<IN? ,CHAIR ,TERMINAL-ROOM> <MOVE ,CHAIR ,HERE> <MOVE ,PLAYER ,CHAIR>)> <MOVE ,ODD-PAPER ,GLOBAL-OBJECTS> <GOTO ,TERMINAL-ROOM> <ROB ,FROB ,PLAYER> <RTRUE>)>
