;           <IN? ,PRSO ,WINNER>>
;         <NOT
;           <FSET? <LOC ,PRSO> ,OPENBIT>>> <THIS-IS-IT ,PRSO> <TELL-OPEN-CLOSED <LOC ,PRSO>> <RFALSE>)
;       (T <FCLEAR ,PRSO ,WEARBIT> <MOVE ,PRSO <LOC ,WINNER>> <RTRUE>)>
; >

; --- IFSOUND ---
