;   <COND (,SOUND-EFFECTS? <FORM PROG () !.FOO>) (ELSE T)>
; >

; --- IKILL ---
; <ROUTINE IKILL (STR)
;   <COND
;       (<NOT ,PRSO> <TELL ,THERES-NOTHING-TO .STR " here." CR>)>
;   <COND
;       (<FSET? ,PRSO ,DOORBIT> <TELL "Pounding on a door is of little use." CR>)
;       (<NOT
