;           1> <FSET ,PRESSURE-VALVE ,OPENBIT> <DEQUEUE I-RATS> <MOVE ,RATS ,GLOBAL-OBJECTS> <TELL
;           "The valve screeches open. A jet spray of live steam issues from it,
