; --- PERFORM ---
; <ROUTINE PERFORM (A "AUX" V OA OO OI CNT "OPT" O I)
;   <SETG
;       PERFORM-DEPTH
;       <+ ,PERFORM-DEPTH 1>>
;   %
;   <DEBUG-CODE
